  "releaseNotes": "'## [10.2.4-prerelease.1](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/compare/v10.2.3...v10.2.4-prerelease.1) (2026-02-18)\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* use Kubernetes JSON serializer for admission webhooks ([#1042](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1042)) ([c77b537](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/c77b5375935d90d457a2526f00fded9b1af8f31d))\n\n### Dependencies\n\n* **ci:** update helm/kind-action action to v1.14.0 ([#1048](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1048)) ([069bcfb](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/069bcfb803afb57e4047c8e4ba1c4034e54b68cb))\n* **docs:** update dependency @easyops-cn/docusaurus-search-local to ^0.53.0 ([#1038](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1038)) ([578acc3](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/578acc308d20338415bf6dd40ae1b7ef6cd1f682))\n* **docs:** update dependency @easyops-cn/docusaurus-search-local to ^0.54.0 ([#1039](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1039)) ([f67f0ea](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/f67f0ea5a4e0cba83d8f68499e96610e9c6be2b4))\n* **docs:** update dependency @easyops-cn/docusaurus-search-local to ^0.55.0 ([#1045](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1045)) ([c781220](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/c7812203480db411e988022c0fa941aeb7d215be))\n* **docs:** update dependency @easyops-cn/docusaurus-search-local to v0.54.1 ([#1040](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1040)) ([77bb903](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/77bb9032398a605986332f03a64f2bf34815c96c))\n* **test:** update dependency coverlet.collector to v8 ([#1046](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1046)) ([3cffd4c](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/3cffd4cc9bcb17f1a2f27956b279d3ca3b7cf68d))\n* **test:** update dependency microsoft.build.framework to 18.3.3 ([#1044](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1044)) ([6778754](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/6778754882d3d00a501e8351cabf4a09379ec393))\n* **test:** update dotnet monorepo ([#1041](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1041)) ([b2e98a0](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/b2e98a04e723e0707f7e51cdc6cd838c8b7dec15))\n* **tools:** update dependency nuget-license to v4.0.7 ([#1043](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1043)) ([9c20c70](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/9c20c7001eaf266f2ab992dc7fe21e02944e7089))\n'",
